# Project Images Directory
# ========================
# Add your project screenshots and images here.
#
# Recommended naming convention:
# - project-name-screenshot.png
# - project-name-architecture.svg
# - project-name-demo.gif
#
# Recommended sizes:
# - Screenshots: 800x600px or 1200x800px
# - Thumbnails: 400x300px
# - Architecture diagrams: SVG preferred
#
# Usage in project-card shortcode:
#   {{< project-card image="/img/projects/your-image.png" ... >}}
